    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Beatles and\n\ntheir neutrality.\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-66-apr-11-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"In Beira, the Greek tanker Ioanna V defied a British embargo on oil for Rhodesia and docked at Mozambique.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "123",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-66-may18.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"New Zealand's fifth Maori King, Koroki Te Wherowhero, 54, has died at Ngaruawhahia.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "117",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-66-June16-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"Two tankers and two tugboats crashed in a fiery disaster in Lower New York Bay.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "118",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-66-OCT19-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"In Oslo, the Norwegian Nobel Committee decided after a 2-hour meeting today not to award the Nobel Peace Prize for 1966.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "109",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-67-May27-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"The New York Generals defeated\nthe California Clippers, 3-0, in a National Professional Soccer\nLeague game before a crowd of 3,027 at New York's Yankee Stadium.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "121",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-67-JUNE30.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"Soviet Premier Kosygin left\nHavana today after 4 days of talk with Cuban Premier Fidel Castro.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "116",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-67-sept10-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "113",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"WE REJECT\n\nWE RESIGN\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-68-28Abr-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"Temperaturas de hoy en el Valle\nde México: Máxima, 25.7 Mínima, 10.4.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "122",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-68-jun5-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"E.U. El senador\nRobert F. Kennedy fue balaceado a las 00.25 horas de hoy, en el\nlobby del hotel Ambassador de Los Angeles, Cal., y su estado es\nde extrema gravedad.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "122",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-68-June6.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "159",
      "height": "122",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"El senador Robert F. Kennedy expiró hoy a las 2:44 de la mañana (hora de México), veinticinco horas y media después de haber sido herido a tiros en la cabeza por al fanático jordano Sirhan Bishara Sirhan, de 24 años de edad.\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-68-14Ago-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "148",
      "height": "123",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Decenas de millares de urugayos desfilaron esta noche en Montevideo por la Universidad en silenciosa protesta por la muerte del estudiante comunista Liber Arce, que fué herido durante los disturbios habidos cecientemente en esta capital.\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-68AGO15.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"Catorce refugiados cubanos huyeron de Cuba en un avión de carga de fabricación rusa, que cruzó el estrecho de la Florida y aterrizó en un aeropuerto a 40 kilómetros, al sur de Miami.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "118",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-68Nov14-s.gif",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"La Unión Soviética anunció que su cosmonave Zond-6 circonvoló hoy la Luna y está continuando su vuelo traslunar.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "115",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-68-Nov30-s.gif",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\" 'Hotel Parque Casino' con una tableta de EXCEDRIN en Montevideo.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "121",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-69JULY20.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"MAN WALKS ON MOON.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "103",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-70MAR18[3].jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": null,
      "height": null,
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Prince Norodom Sihanouk, Chief\nof State of Cambodia, was overthrown today in his absence, the Pnompenh\nradio announced.\"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\"A limited withdrawal of civilians and soldiers from army headquarters\nat Long tieng, Laos began today after the United States-supported\nbase nearby at Sam Thong fell to 2,000 North Vietnamese troops.\"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\"United States' postal system's first strike started today in\nthe New York metropolitan area.\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-70-Dec26-s.gif",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "\"Saboto.\"",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "117",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-71JUNE3.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "115",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"North Vietnam announced today that it was\ncanceling all arrangements to receive sick and wounded prisoners of\nwar from the South on the ground that only 13 out of 570 originally\nannounced would be transferred.\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/concept/tautology/on-kawara/ts-71-Mar3.jpg",
